{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20268eCbCMhO4k1793008017.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>形象甜美的陳瀅（Jeannie）近日在劇集《璀璨之城》中迎來不少突破性戲份，深受觀眾及網民喜愛。日前適逢她的生日，陳瀅特別安排了一場極具儀式感的海邊浪漫生日派對，並於社交平台上載一輯慶生靚相及影片，大派性感福利，瞬間融化大批粉絲。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4166b38a-f50a-468d-8672-008104043556.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026juuQWXmMhh1793008017.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>從陳瀅分享的照片中所見，當晚的派對選址於海邊戶外餐廳，現場佈置極其用心。除了有滿滿的粉橙色氣球海與鮮花點綴，背後更有迷人夜景襯托。作為壽星女的陳瀅身穿一套牛油果色的吊帶連身裙亮相，散發出濃厚的女人味。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"3a15a2b0-0ed8-4d1e-b8b5-14985059e17d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026RXtU1vEfx81793008016.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>靚相曝光後，隨即引來大批圈中好友及網民湧入留言區送上祝福。大家紛紛激讚她「太美了」，並留言直呼：「Jeannie 生日快樂！越嚟越索」、「呢紮花同個人都咁靚」，更有人大讚她「又甜又辣，美出新高度！」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:54.260174+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T15:18:15.796431+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:10.261930+00:00","content_hash":"a16106f4a82afb8367c86d79b71ce4a8130e6e73428121dd02663978eb462e76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:54.260174+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}